      "title": "Question 3 · C program segment",
      "markdown": "There are six integer variables, a, b, c, d, e and f . You are asked to sort them in ascending order, i.e. a≤b≤c≤d≤e≤f. There is a procedure sort(x,y,z), where x, y and z are integers that are passed by reference. After a call of this procedure, the variables will be sorted such that x≤y≤z.",
